+### Prepending listeners
+
+Use `prependListener` or `prependOnceListener` to run a listener before all
+listeners already registered for an event. Each new prepended listener runs
+before earlier prepended listeners as well.
+
+```js
+EE.on('event-name', emitted, context);
+EE.prependListener('event-name', emitted, context);
+EE.prependOnceListener('event-name', emitted, context);
+```
+
